  "description": "In front of Woojoo, a boy who had lost interest in his tumultuous life, Pyeonghwa, a singer trainee, appeared as a presence more exciting, thrilling, and radiant than anything else. Woojoo had always thought that just watching Pyeonghwa debut from the sidelines would be enough, but before he knew it, he began to dream of standing by his side.As Pyeonghwa approaches without hesitation, precious feelings begin to sprout in Woojoo, and those feelings build and build, eventually turning into a greedy desire called \"love.\"\nSource: MU",
